<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/access-control">Access Control</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">RFID Access Cards</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Access Control products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s active" href="/markets/access-control/rfid-cards"><span class="abbr">RC</span><span class="label">RFID Access Cards</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/access-control/smart-lock-assembly"><span class="abbr">SL</span><span class="label">Smart Lock &amp; Door Hardware</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the credential or lock has to do and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Access Control &middot; RFID Access Cards</div><h1 class="mk-h1">RFID access card manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures RFID cards, fobs and access credentials from inlay production through to finished products. Automated RFID manufacturing processes are supported by more than 20 years of experience in credential and inlay production.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-rfid-cards" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-access-control-card-rfid-cards.webp" alt="RFID access card and reader" style="height:420px;object-fit:cover;"/></div></div></section><section id="specialize-rfid-cards" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">RFID credential manufacturing requires controlled chip attachment, antenna performance, encoding and unique-ID management throughout production. Hana supports the process from inlay manufacturing through to finished cards and fobs, with read/write verification and personalization available within the production flow. Reader hardware can also be manufactured within the Hana group.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Credential inlay and card build</span></div><div class="desc">HF and UHF inlay manufacturing through to laminated, printed and finished cards and fobs using automated production processes.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Secure chip handling</span></div><div class="desc">Controlled chip attachment, encoding and personalization, including unique-ID management to program requirements.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Read and write verification</span></div><div class="desc">Read/write verification and ID tracking can be integrated into production so each credential is checked before shipment.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Further process detail covering antenna construction, chip attachment and lamination is available on the RFID Inlay capability page.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/rfid-smart-tags/rfid-inlays">Explore RFID Inlay <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">automated RFID inlay lines, card &amp; credential production</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">UHF and HF inlays &amp; straps</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What access credential formats can Hana manufacture?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">HF and UHF cards, fobs and credentials, from the inlay through to the finished, personalized card. The exact format and frequency list is confirmed with our team for your access system.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana handle secure chips during production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Chip attach, encoding and personalization run as a controlled process with unique-ID management and read/write verification, so every credential is tested and accounted for.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What volumes can Hana support for card programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Card and credential work runs on automated inlay lines built for volume, across more than one country, so a program can scale and be dual-sourced within one company.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/access-control" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Access Control market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your access-credential program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>